1
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:04,300
You all want a raise too

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:04,966
That's right

3
00:00:05,466 --> 00:00:07,666
If we don't get a raise we'll quit

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:08,700
Yeah

5
00:00:09,266 --> 00:00:10,400
No raise we leave

6
00:00:11,033 --> 00:00:12,133
How much do you want

7
00:00:12,266 --> 00:00:13,300
15,000

8
00:00:13,466 --> 00:00:14,533
Do you all think so too

9
00:00:15,066 --> 00:00:15,733
Lewes

10
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:17,333
We guys

11
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:18,589
work day and night to take care of

12
00:00:18,589 --> 00:00:19,333
these frogs for you

13
00:00:19,666 --> 00:00:20,866
You do nothing

14
00:00:21,233 --> 00:00:23,133
and make 10 million just by reselling them

15
00:00:23,966 --> 00:00:25,400
Giving us 15,000 a month

16
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:26,166
isn't too much to ask

17
00:00:26,166 --> 00:00:27,000
Guys

18
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:28,333
Am I right

19
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,200
Exactly

20
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:30,366
Give us a raise

21
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:32,933
You really think you did all the work

22
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:33,766
Besides

23
00:00:34,233 --> 00:00:35,133
the pay I give you

24
00:00:35,133 --> 00:00:36,533
is already the highest in the industry

25
00:00:36,533 --> 00:00:37,333
Others only pay 4,000

26
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:38,466
Walter's 10 million order

27
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,700
is due for delivery next month

28
00:00:40,166 --> 00:00:41,166
We'll all leave if we don't get a raise

29
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:42,433
Let's see if you can

30
00:00:42,433 --> 00:00:43,074
manage three greenhouses

31
00:00:43,074 --> 00:00:43,366
by yourself

32
00:00:43,366 --> 00:00:44,000
Yeah

33
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:45,333
No raise we leave

34
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:46,633
If you force us out

35
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:47,900
this order is ruined

36
00:00:52,466 --> 00:00:52,666
Fine

37
00:00:53,733 --> 00:00:54,666
You're all fired

38
00:00:54,966 --> 00:00:55,633
Boss

39
00:00:55,933 --> 00:00:57,000
Are you sure about this

40
00:00:57,333 --> 00:00:59,033
That's a 10 million order

41
00:00:59,066 --> 00:01:00,933
You're saving a few thousand on wages

42
00:01:00,933 --> 00:01:02,400
at the cost of a 10 million order

43
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:05,200
That's my business

44
00:01:05,633 --> 00:01:06,300
Now

45
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,333
please leave my farm

46
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,233
Guys he treats us like dirt

47
00:01:10,266 --> 00:01:11,733
why should we stay

48
00:01:11,733 --> 00:01:13,333
Anyway when he can't deliver

49
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:14,600
we won't be the ones losing money

50
00:01:16,866 --> 00:01:18,800
Don't regret it Lewes

51
00:01:18,833 --> 00:01:20,433
Even if you beg us on your knees

52
00:01:20,433 --> 00:01:21,533
we won't come back

53
00:01:21,866 --> 00:01:22,466
What did you say

54
00:01:22,733 --> 00:01:24,033
Lewes' farm is going bankrupt

55
00:01:24,066 --> 00:01:25,000
To save some wages

56
00:01:25,033 --> 00:01:26,033
he fired all of us

57
00:01:26,033 --> 00:01:26,866
From yesterday until now

58
00:01:26,866 --> 00:01:28,266
his frogs haven't been fed at all

59
00:01:28,266 --> 00:01:29,400
They'll all starve to death in two days

60
00:01:29,433 --> 00:01:30,633
He signed a contract

61
00:01:30,666 --> 00:01:31,566
If he can't deliver 50,000 frogs

62
00:01:31,566 --> 00:01:31,866
next month

63
00:01:31,866 --> 00:01:33,066
he'll have to pay 30 million in compensation

64
00:01:33,166 --> 00:01:34,100
30 million

65
00:01:34,533 --> 00:01:35,433
That's so much money

66
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:36,604
His previous earnings aren't

67
00:01:36,604 --> 00:01:37,166
enough to cover it

68
00:01:38,033 --> 00:01:39,866
I'd say Lewes got cocky

69
00:01:40,266 --> 00:01:41,333
The big frog farmers in town

70
00:01:41,333 --> 00:01:42,533
didn't even dare to take the order

71
00:01:42,533 --> 00:01:44,366
yet he dared to take it as a beginner

72
00:01:44,766 --> 00:01:45,366
Now look

73
00:01:45,666 --> 00:01:46,600
he dug his own grave

74
00:01:48,766 --> 00:01:49,666
Dear

75
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,166
Is Lewes really in trouble

76
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:52,866
Let's go

77
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:53,966
Let's go check on him
